By downloading, installing or using the Software you agree to this license.
If you use it on behalf of an organisation, you agree for that organisation,
and "you" means it too. If you do not agree, do not use the Software.


2. What you may do, free of charge

While this license is in force, the Licensor grants you a worldwide,
non-exclusive, non-transferable, non-sublicensable license to:

  (a) install and run the Software, as the Licensor publishes it, on systems
      you control, for any number of hosts and users;

  (b) use it to protect your own organisation and, with the MSP edition, to
